  {
    "location": "body/semantic/29",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ is a free educational simulator. It does not execute real trades, does not hold money, and is not a broker, exchange or investment adviser. Nothing on the site is investment, financial, legal or tax advice, and no content is personalised to your circumstances.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-029",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ is a free educational simulator. It does not execute real trades, does not hold money, and is not a broker, exchange or investment adviser. Nothing on the site is investment, financial, legal or tax advice, and no content is personalised to your circumstances.",
    "sha256": "30fc1621d2cfc132c4dfc40762db3cb307830bef0e5a1199679326e01616b78f"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/30",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Your responsibilities",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-030",
    "contextText": "Your responsibilities",
    "sha256": "dde69006e2cd5202680d6ebf05a38f3ae2977b4acabeed3fd18a1839156f79d5"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/31",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Use the simulator for learning, not as a source of trading recommendations.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-031",
    "contextText": "Use the simulator for learning, not as a source of trading recommendations.",
    "sha256": "fa0847e5d485bc91758c87714dfaeca2aab9634ce85680b95baa1d563e7d740c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/32",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Do not present simulated results as real trading performance to anyone.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-032",
    "contextText": "Do not present simulated results as real trading performance to anyone.",
    "sha256": "01a3ccacfffeb0bd36c9309c208bc55c56483ff8a10b0a7dad71880d99ffd52c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/33",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Do not scrape, resell or republish the site's lessons and guides without permission.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-033",
    "contextText": "Do not scrape, resell or republish the site's lessons and guides without permission.",
    "sha256": "9456f1bddf1e2f036739da382616532b26a77b5819eef1fc490fd8b90bf97db8"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/34",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Follow the laws that apply where you live before trading with real money anywhere.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-034",
    "contextText": "Follow the laws that apply where you live before trading with real money anywhere.",
    "sha256": "860d2af6914fd45995301152fbd51b1e1a13b15b1b8a2ed7e45f0d21d7cd2dab"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/35",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Liability and accuracy",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-035",
    "contextText": "Liability and accuracy",
    "sha256": "f1f6b4784c227e7df2790ac8e57c79e51205d1a044747fbec52742aebe43e2dc"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/36",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Market data may be delayed, incomplete or simulated between refreshes, and lessons may contain errors. We make no warranty of accuracy. The limitations in these Terms apply only to the extent permitted by law and are subject to mandatory rights that apply in your location. Past simulated performance does not predict future real-world performance.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-036",
    "contextText": "Market data may be delayed, incomplete or simulated between refreshes, and lessons may contain errors. We make no warranty of accuracy. The limitations in these Terms apply only to the extent permitted by law and are subject to mandatory rights that apply in your location. Past simulated performance does not predict future real-world performance.",
    "sha256": "3387e43cffebfb031393553fdc6a3616d83ed6de20f2f6ec5196f26f55d3f3b4"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/37",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "No advisory relationship",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-037",
    "contextText": "No advisory relationship",
    "sha256": "f5429636225bfb0096ebf1a526f19790ff8f7fbc9d17ee6619d4bd1bdd771e35"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/38",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Using this site creates no advisory, fiduciary or brokerage relationship of any kind. Lessons, glossary entries, comparisons, strategy walkthroughs and educational mentor responses are general educational information published to the public at large, with no knowledge of your circumstances, objectives, tax position or risk tolerance.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-038",
    "contextText": "Using this site creates no advisory, fiduciary or brokerage relationship of any kind. Lessons, glossary entries, comparisons, strategy walkthroughs and educational mentor responses are general educational information published to the public at large, with no knowledge of your circumstances, objectives, tax position or risk tolerance.",
    "sha256": "9c2d104c9495df66e3cd5b1a763d6964ce29ca0fce6a3e25ad368b0e5e4e55b4"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/39",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Before trading real money, consider seeking advice from a professional licensed in your jurisdiction. Leverage magnifies gains and losses; whether losses can exceed a deposit depends on the product, account protections and applicable rules. TradeHQ does not provide leverage or establish a loss rate for retail traders.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-039",
    "contextText": "Before trading real money, consider seeking advice from a professional licensed in your jurisdiction. Leverage magnifies gains and losses; whether losses can exceed a deposit depends on the product, account protections and applicable rules. TradeHQ does not provide leverage or establish a loss rate for retail traders.",
    "sha256": "b77efa71df528db9cedb6827219977adfe2ceb3af7f6700201323943880ad334"
  },
  {
