    "kind": "li",
    "text": "TradeHQ claims rights in its original educational writing to the extent those rights belong to its publisher. Third-party material retains its owners’ rights and applicable licenses. Reuse must respect the applicable rights and license terms.",
    "id": "TERMS-NOJS-041",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ claims rights in its original educational writing to the extent those rights belong to its publisher. Third-party material retains its owners’ rights and applicable licenses. Reuse must respect the applicable rights and license terms.",
    "sha256": "7d3bb819e6cc503b24ba41b91428888e9f03d18bf2f72f740339b8efdbf1b704"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/42",
